702
00:56:05,520 --> 00:56:19,460
Eli, EliYou can't tell left from right

703
00:56:20,320 --> 00:56:26,820
Eli, Eli

704
00:56:28,040 --> 00:56:34,960
Your eyes are black and white

705
00:56:55,340 --> 00:57:03,200
